body:
Using the same EBNF syntax as in #7, using the insight from #15 to get rid of resolveMeDesc.
(uses https://github.com/ocapn/syrup/issues/8 for the syrup EBNF)

This is what I am calling option A of this proposal:

```ebnf
protocol_msgs := protocol_msg [ protocol_msgs ]
protocol_msg :=  op_deliver_only | op_deliver | op_abort | op_listen | op_gc_export | op_gc_answer | op_pick
op_deliver_only := syrup_record("op:deliver-only", toDesc, method, args, kwargs)
op_deliver := syrup_record("op:deliver", toDesc, method, args, kwargs, answerPos)
op_abort := syrup_record("op:abort", abortReason)
op_listen := syrup_record("op:listen", toDesc, listenerDesc)
op_gc_export := syrup_record("op:gc-export", exportPos, wireDelta)
op_gc_answer := syrup_record("op:gc-answer", answerPos)
op_pick := syrup_record("op:pick", toDesc, selection, answerPos)
answerPos := syrup_positive_integer
toDesc := desc
listenerDesc := desc
method := syrup_false | syrup_symbol
args := syrup_list(any)
kwargs := syrup_dict(any, any)
selection := any
any := syrup_any | desc
abortReason := any # tbd: but usually an string with the error  -Zarutian
exportPos := syrup_positive_integer
wireDelta := syrup_positive_integer

desc := desc_new_import_obj | desc_import_object | desc_new_import_promise | desc_import_promise | desc_export | desc_answer | desc_handoff | desc_NonceLocator
desc_new_import_object := syrup_record("desc:import-new-object", pos, ?tbd: allegedInterfaceDescription?)
desc_import_object := syrup_record("desc:import-object", pos)
desc_new_import_promise := syrup_record("desc:import-new-promise", pos)
desc_import_promise := syrup_record("desc:import-promise", pos)
desc_export := syrup_record("desc:export", pos)
desc_answer := syrup_record("desc:answer", pos)
desc_NonceLocator := syrup_record("desc:export", 0) # follows the tradition of E. -Zarutian
pos := syrup_positive_integer
desc_handoff := syrup_record("desc:Promise3", searchPath, hostVatId, giftNonce, vine) # same as Promise3Desc of CapTP of E -Zarutian
searchPath := syrup_list(ocapnMachineUri)
ocapnMachineUri := syrup_string
hostVatId := vatId
giftNonce := syrup_positive_integer
vine := any
vatId := ?tbd: vatDesignator vatMsgAuthenticator | cryptographicHash(<public key of the vat>) ?

```

This expects a NonceLocator at each end of a CapTP connection.

```js
// ts-check
// uses the same jsdoc as Agoric

/*
@define NonceLocator
@property {getBootstrap} getBootstrapObject  replaces op:bootstrap in the older ocapn captp.
